# Copy to .env and fill. NEVER commit .env.
# Only bootstrap values live here and on Vercel (Production + Preview).
# SMTP (and optional Gmail-API alert) settings are set in the dashboard
# (dashboard.ferozarshad.com → Settings → Website) and fetched at runtime by
